# Goal

This campaign tests the first history-typing obligation immediately downstream
of Source/Eta Block 03.  It asks whether the Record-only six-neighbor event
surface can itself supply a lawful append-only successor event, or whether a
different physical formation mechanism must be constructed before composing
two one-event writers.

## Exact target contract

| Field | Contract |
|---|---|
| Target statement | For a partial Record state `R: Omega -> {0,1}` on `Z^3`, with signed nearest-neighbor shell `D={+-e1,+-e2,+-e3}` and ready set `F(R)={x notin Omega: x+D subset Omega}`, classify exactly how `F`, every supplied six-Record condition `eta_x`, and the Block-03 writer typing change under one append `R' = R union {x -> b}`. |
| Quantifiers/domain | Every subset `Omega` for which the displayed inclusions are meaningful, every `x in F(R)`, both outcomes `b`, all six directions, all 64 local masks, and the 24-condition active H1 orbit separately. |
| Allowed premises | The frozen lattice adjacency and Record semantics; Block-03's conditional one-event writer and exact active-orbit decoder; ordinary set/map logic. |
| Forbidden weakenings | No supplied event order, site label, clock, rate, hidden non-Record neighbor values, reset, overwritten Record, scalar probability table, or compatibility row relabelled as a reachable successor. |
| Required edge cases | Empty ready set; multiple ready sites; overlapping shells; infinite `Omega`; complement masks; inactive masks; simultaneous updates; and a prospective adjacent successor `x+d`. |
| Completion witness | A symbolic proof plus exhaustive finite semantic checker and independently structured checker that return the exact ready-set update, successor typing, information deficit, and scope classification while rejecting actual-object mutations. |
| Outcomes not counted as closure | Counting formal completions of an underdetermined neighbor mask; composing Kraus blocks whose target is already occupied; selecting a site/rate by fiat; or calling a bounded Record-only failure a universal dynamics or axiom no-go. |

