## Stage A: semantic type gate

Represent a physical state as the partial map itself, not merely one local
mask.  Verify the event preconditions `x notin Omega` and `x+D subset Omega`,
append exactly one permanent value, and recompute the entire ready set.  Test
the candidate identities

```text
F(R union {x -> b}) = F(R) minus {x},
eta_y(R union {x -> b}) = eta_y(R) for y in F(R) minus {x}.
```

These are targets to test, not preregistered results.  If either fails, return
the smallest explicit counterexample and the corrected identity.

## Stage B: direct-successor and information gate

For each active `eta_x`, outcome `b`, and direction `d`, type-check the nominal
successor at `x+d`.  Separately enumerate the 32 formal completions of the five
outer-shell values not fixed by `(eta_x,b,d)`.  The 9,216 active-orbit rows are
compatibility data only unless a physical partial state supplies them and the
target site is fresh.

Return distinct terminals for:

- `NO-FRESH-NEIGHBOR` when `x+d` is already in the Record domain;
- `SUCCESSOR-STATE-MISSING` when a nominal local tuple omits physical shell
  values;
- `SITE-SELECTOR-MISSING` when several physical ready sites exist but no
  formation rule selects among them; and
- `TYPED-SUCCESSOR` only when a complete partial state and a fresh target make
  the next event legal.

## Stage C: route and axiom adjudication

Stress-test at least five materially distinct exits before interpreting any
negative:

1. non-Record quantum neighbor conditions;
2. a less-than-six-neighbor front/readiness predicate;
3. a synchronous update of all compatible fresh sites;
4. a normalized site POVM or local hazard with an explicit no-event channel;
5. an external source/participant process that changes the Record domain; and
6. an exact shared-carrier compiler once its full-M2 gluing and participant
   sector are proved.

The narrow type theorem may identify a model boundary.  It must not be called
an axiom defect unless the no-go discipline closes all live derived routes and
the minimal axiom wording itself, rather than the chosen Record-only
realization, is the load-bearing cause.  A constructive route remains the
preferred next block whenever one survives.

